        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.travellens.co/best-things-to-do-in-blackshear-ga/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During the Civil War, Blackshear briefly held a prisoner‑of‑war camp for over 5,000 Union soldiers.",
