      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blackshear%2C_Georgia",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The first brick tobacco warehouse in Georgia, the Brantley Brick, was built in Blackshear.",
